# Build artifacts
output/

# Runtime-generated private memory — NEVER commit these.
# The tool writes driver profiles, qualitative sources, league notes, and chat
# history here at runtime. They can contain personal reads on real people, so
# they stay local. corrections.md (curated stat facts) is the only tracked file
# under memory/. Fictional demo data lives in examples/ instead.
memory/profiles/
memory/sources/
memory/league.md
memory/chat_history.json
memory/chat_history.json.*

# OS
.DS_Store
